window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A time of peace shaken by acts of violence. A world on the cusp of war. The eternal battle of good versus evil. Can it really be that simple?<br> <br> The world of Galamud, once embroiled in war between the factions of Light and Dark, has experienced a millennium of peace. Recent events have shaken that peace, threatening to bring the horrors of war to its inhabitants once again. Join our hero as he is thrown into the turmoil of war before venturing out for the answers to bring stability and harmony back to Galamud and all of its people.<br> <br> Can the answers be found in the teachings of the Goddess? Or perhaps in the darkest reaches of the continent? Tales of adventure, forged bonds, loss and manipulation await.</p>"; 
